{"id": "g29_027", "standalone_claim_ok": true, "e_contrast_ok": true, "x_contrast_ok": true, "record_only_viable": true, "issue": "E_A is internally self-contradictory: it states 24,747 confirmed cases, 1,809 deaths, and 2,335 recoveries, which arithmetically leaves 20,603 active cases, yet claims 14,955. The stated active-case figure (14,955) still falls below the 17,000 threshold, so the E_A/E_B contrast remains meaningful for the claim."}
